      "comment": "BENTLEY KRISTOFF (6) has a strong winning strike-rate this journey having won three of five starts. Hit the frame latest (21.91) when third at this track in a Grade 5. Looks suited and should go close. CRITICAL MOMENT (3) missed the frame last time at Capalaba but the start prior rocketed around 366m at Capalaba in 19.85. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. HARA'S TANK (1) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from six starts. Was out of the placings last time (30.29) at Q Parklands in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Can feature in the finish. BAGLESS BRUTE (8) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
